## 3. Coordination des champs de state (dict-based)

`CustomAgentState` hérite de `MessagesState` → **dict** : les nodes accèdent par
`state.get(...)`, jamais par attribut (PoC-2). Les services sérialisent en dicts
(`model_dump()`).

| Champ | Écrit par | Lu par |
|-------|-----------|--------|
| `routing_result` | router | retrieval, fallback, route_after_router |
| `knowledge` / `web` | retrieval | fallback, context |
| `fallback` | fallback | context, response |
| `built_context` | context | learning, middleware (subgraph) |
| `learning_decision` | learning | middleware (subgraph) |
| `learning_activity` | learning | response |
| `agent_response` | response | runner |

